        "id": "70860a9cee51494e",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "a5406ced814d1895",
        "name": "Users API endpoints\\n \\n Routes:\\n - {GET} /users\\n     • Without query: returns all users\\n     • Can optionally support filters in the future (e.g., ?role=admin) \\n - {GET} /user\\n     • ?id=XXX: returns a user filtered by its ID\\n     • Validates parameters and returns 400 if missing or invalid\\n",
        "info": "Users API endpoints\\n\n\\n\nRoutes:\\n\n- {GET} /users\\n\n    • Without query: returns all users\\n\n    • Can optionally support filters in the future (e.g., ?role=admin)\n\\n\n- {GET} /user\\n\n    • ?id=XXX: returns a user filtered by its ID\\n\n    • Validates parameters and returns 400 if missing or invalid\\n",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 640,
        "wires": []
    },
