        "name": "Detections API endpoints\\n \\n Routes:\\n - GET /detections\\n     • Without query: returns all detections\\n     • ?userId=XXX: returns detections filtered by a specific user\\n     • ?plate=XXX: returns detections filtered by a specific      \\n vehicle plate\\n     • Multiple filters can be combined (?userId=XXX&plate=XXX)\\n \\n - GET /detection\\n     • ?id=XXX: returns a detection filtered by its ID\\n     • Validates parameters and returns 400 if missing or invalid\\n",
        "info": "Detections API endpoints\\n\n\\n\nRoutes:\\n\n- GET /detections\\n\n    • Without query: returns all detections\\n\n    • ?userId=XXX: returns detections filtered by a specific user\\n\n    • ?plate=XXX: returns detections filtered by a specific \n    \\n vehicle plate\\n\n    • Multiple filters can be combined (?userId=XXX&plate=XXX)\\n\n\\n\n- GET /detection\\n\n    • ?id=XXX: returns a detection filtered by its ID\\n\n    • Validates parameters and returns 400 if missing or invalid\\n\n",
