    {
        "id": "c5fab67d44a35626",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "01df77f7ae4c4f86",
        "name": "Flow to adjust parameters",
        "info": "ES\nEste flujo ajusta parametros de simulacion (camaras, probabilidades, ritmo) desde varios injects, los guarda en flow, construye un payload con defaults si falta algun valor y lo envia por HTTP POST a /admin/update, mostrando el payload y la respuesta en debug.\n\nEN \nThis flow updates simulation parameters (cameras, probabilities, pacing) via inject nodes, stores them in flow, builds a payload with defaults when a value is missing, and sends it by HTTP POST to /admin/update, showing both the payload and the response in the debug panel.",
        "x": 170,
        "y": 60,
        "wires": []
    },
    {
        "id": "c75b2307c72af870",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "01df77f7ae4c4f86",
        "name": "Flow to start / stop simulations",
        "info": "",
        "x": 180,
        "y": 460,
        "wires": []
    },
    {
        "id": "a964a6cfbad38ca7",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "01df77f7ae4c4f86",
        "name": "This flow represent how to manage the alerts",
        "info": "ES\nEste flujo recibe alertas por POST /alerts, parsea el JSON y enruta por tipo. Si es ITV y está caducada o próxima, construye y envía un email y un aviso por Telegram; si es POLICE, envía un aviso por Telegram. El resto de alertas se muestran en debug.\n\nEN \nThis flow receives alerts via POST /alerts, parses the JSON, and routes by type. If it is ITV and expired or near expiry, it builds and sends an email and a Telegram notice; if it is POLICE, it sends a Telegram alert. Any other alerts are shown in debug.",
        "x": 230,
        "y": 880,
        "wires": []
    },
